flowchart TD
 R[FileRef / Version] --> CLASS[Classify sensitivity]
 CLASS --> RULE[.LADONignore + Mandatory Deny]
 RULE --> D{External transfer allowed?}
 D -->|No| LOCAL[Local-only history and processing]
 D -->|Yes| AUTH{User explicit storage authorization?}
 AUTH -->|No| LOCAL
 AUTH -->|Yes| ENC[AES-GCM + Zstd]
 ENC --> OUT[Provider upload and verify]
